{"type":"text","timestamp":1778976805257,"sessionID":"ses_1ccb88036ffeTs2Cu18GOUFw8e","part":{"id":"prt_e3347c35b001Lxnux5j950Wrpk","messageID":"msg_e3347ba1e0019wMSXrFILgrobI","sessionID":"ses_1ccb88036ffeTs2Cu18GOUFw8e","type":"text","text":"The issue requests several new mouth/salivary gland cell terms. I’m checking whether each label or synonym already exists, then I’ll add only clearly supported terms using the requested parent/location patterns.","time":{"start":1778976801627,"end":1778976805255}}}
