ateral septum and the median eminence. It is contributing to neuroendocrine functions, locomotion and stress regulation.\")\n35457: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072011 \"2025-05-06T12:46:22Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35458: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072011 \"A14 dopaminergic neuron\")\n35459: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072011 obo:CL_0000700)\n35460: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072011 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002322))\n35461: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072011 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0061527))\n35462: \n35463: # Class: obo:CL_4072012 (A15 dopaminergic neuron)\n35464: \n35465: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:26132331\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:36209152\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072012 \"A type of dopaminergic neuron located in the preoptic periventricular nucleus of the hypothalamus and implicated in neuroendocrine modulation.\")\n35466: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072012 \"2025-05-06T13:00:54Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35467: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072012 \"A15 dopaminergic neuron\")\n35468: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072012 obo:CL_0000700)\n35469: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072012 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002622))\n35470: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072012 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0061527))\n35471: \n35472: # Class: obo:CL_4072013 (A16 dopaminergic neuron)\n35473: \n35474: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:28261065\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:/10.1101/2023.08.29.554772\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072013 \"A type of dopaminergic interneuron located in the glomerular layer of the main olfactory bulb, characterized by the co-release of dopamine and GABA, and involved in modulating sensory input within olfactory circuits.\")\n35475: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072013 \"2025-05-06T13:12:14Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n\n(Showing lines 35256-35475 of 36011. Use offset=35476 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Class: obo