{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977073467,"sessionID":"ses_1ccb88036ffeTs2Cu18GOUFw8e","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_Ti45E6OLqtU7EUmmmcVxhb2O","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Changes committed locally for PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added the requested mouth/salivary gland cell terms with definitions, synonyms, location/function axioms, contributor metadata, and links back to this issue.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+## Summary\n+\n+Added eight new Cell Ontology terms requested in issue #3597:\n+\n+- `CL_9900001` serous demilune cell of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900002` basal duct cell of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900003` periductal fibroblast of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900004` junctional epithelial cell\n+- `CL_9900005` tuft cell of parotid gland\n+- `CL_9900006` tuft cell of sublingual gland\n+- `CL_9900007` ionocyte of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900008` myoepithelial cell of salivary gland\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The requested labels and close synonyms were not already present in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`. The new terms were added near the existing salivary gland term block and follow the local pattern of adding a declaration, textual definition with publication xrefs, contributor metadata, creation date, synonyms, label, and genus-location logical axioms.\n+\n+I used conservative logical definitions based on the requested parent terms and anatomical locations. Where function assertions were requested and already used in CL patterns, I added `capable_of` axioms for saliva secretion, innate immune response in mucosa, monoatomic ion homeostasis, and smooth muscle contraction.\n+\n+## Completed Checklist\n+\n+- Checked `cl-edit.owl` for existing matching labels and synonyms.\n+- Checked requested parent terms in `cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Added definition xrefs using the PMIDs supplied in the issue.\n+- Added requester ORCID `0000-0002-5507-2103` as `terms:contributor` for each new term.\n+- Added `terms:creator \"GitHub Copilot\"` and `terms:date` to each new term.\n+- Added `IAO:0000233` tracker annotations linking each new term to issue #3597.\n+- Validated ontology syntax with `robot convert`.\n+- Ran ELK reasoning with `robot reason` successfully.\n+\n+## Notes\n+\n+The project guide recommends `aurelian fulltext` for PMID lookups, but `aurelian` is not installed in this environment, so I could not use that helper. Definitions and xrefs were based on the issue text and existing ontology patterns.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Changes committed locally for PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added the requested mouth/salivary gland cell terms with definitions, synonyms, location/function axioms, contributor metadata, and links back to this issue.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+Added eight new Cell Ontology terms requested in issue #3597:\n+\n+- `CL_9900001` serous demilune cell of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900002` basal duct cell of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900003` periductal fibroblast of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900004` junctional epithelial cell\n+- `CL_9900005` tuft cell of parotid gland\n+- `CL_9900006` tuft cell of sublingual gland\n+- `CL_9900007` ionocyte of salivary gland\n+- `CL_9900008` myoepithelial cell of salivary gland\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The reque