{"type":"text","timestamp":1778977093380,"sessionID":"ses_1ccb88036ffeTs2Cu18GOUFw8e","part":{"id":"prt_e334c1aec0011xqkJ8ZMsEVIGy","messageID":"msg_e334c11cb001gZ62qQjwtOEOHn","sessionID":"ses_1ccb88036ffeTs2Cu18GOUFw8e","type":"text","text":"Implemented issue #3597 and committed the ontology change locally.\n\n- Commit: `b292307 Add mouth cell terms for issue 3597`\n- Edited and committed: `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`\n- Added uncommitted feedback files: `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md`, `PR_COMMENTS.md`\n\nAdded eight new terms:\n\n- `CL_9900001` serous demilune cell of salivary gland\n- `CL_9900002` basal duct cell of salivary gland\n- `CL_9900003` periductal fibroblast of salivary gland\n- `CL_9900004` junctional epithelial cell\n- `CL_9900005` tuft cell of parotid gland\n- `CL_9900006` tuft cell of sublingual gland\n- `CL_9900007` ionocyte of salivary gland\n- `CL_9900008` myoepithelial cell of salivary gland\n\nValidation completed successfully:\n\n- `robot convert -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-check.owl`\n- `robot reason -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --reasoner ELK --equivalent-classes-allowed asserted-only --exclude-tautologies structural -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-reasoned.owl`\n\nNote: `aurelian fulltext PMID:23209333` could not be run because `aurelian` is not installed in this environment. I documented that in `PR_COMMENTS.md`.\n\nExisting unrelated working tree items were left untouched, including the pre-existing deletion of `.github/copilot-instructions.md` and evaluation files.","time":{"start":1778977086188,"end":1778977093377}}}
